{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/36d436ts","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":113},"text":"Every test case on the platform: the participants' typed requests and the main-grid test cases, each with its reply, screenshots and a recall check in a new conversation about a month later.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
