{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o7mlwbud","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":384,"width":310,"height":76},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bax47qto","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":384,"width":1105,"height":76},"text":"Outcomes counted by deletion method, then split by which recall check found the fact, same chat against new chat, and what the chatbot said.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/q943yls3","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":470,"width":310,"height":113},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kzyhobq5","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":470,"width":1105,"height":113},"text":"Possible explanations, including ordinary ones (account setup, mix-ups between test cases, run errors), each checked against the evidence; what we cannot observe is a hypothesis.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lk7yhg7q","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":593,"width":310,"height":76},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yxwzm18f","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":593,"width":1105,"height":76},"text":"Kept only if they hold across test cases and the ordinary explanations do not account for them.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jypgf6p0","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":679,"width":310,"height":76},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
