{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/to7yl072","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":765,"width":310,"height":76},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6lgzql8b","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":415,"top":765,"width":1105,"height":76},"text":"Each survey answer matched to one audit measure, method against method.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/xkwb3q","slideIndex":1,"text":"We repeated these steps in the same order for every platform, so the five points on each platform slide come from steps 3 to 7. Can't tell is always its own count, and the file-upload test cases are analysed separately."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/xb3vg0","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/876x0ny5","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"ChatGPT","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
