{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fixoredw","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":143.6},"text":"A typed request hides the fact but does not remove it (108 of 131 came back); clearing memories, history or custom instructions also failed (6 of 9), and only the most extensive deletion stopped it.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/uho7i9wb","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":328.6,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hkf6tov2","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":328.6,"width":1105,"height":106.6},"text":"It is treated as \"don't mention it\"; past conversations are still used.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gj6pkjeh","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":445.2,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ze183id0","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":445.2,"width":1105,"height":106.6},"text":"Typed requests suppress without removing; the same-chat check misleads (104 of 129).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yds7udwf","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":561.8,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/g7ypsnep","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":561.8,"width":1105,"height":106.6},"text":"Kept to the letter (130 of 133); the caveat that past conversations remain explains the return.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/h876lsfa","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":678.4,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ulg7qdwj","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":415,"top":678.4,"width":1105,"height":106.6},"text":"The method rated most protective fails, and the usual check hides it.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/xb3vg0","slideIndex":2,"text":"ChatGPT hides the fact in the same chat but still gives it in a new one, even in 8 of the 12 cases where it confirmed the deletion. That fits OpenAI's own statement that past conversations remain, and the check most people use, asking in the same chat, is the one that hides it."}
