{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zi1cnupg","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"A typed request removed the fact (0 of 131 came back) and so did deleting a memory; deleting the conversation did not (2 of 2).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ehsvepov","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":299,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1kjep476","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":299,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Memory is topic files; a typed request edits them, deleting a conversation leaves them.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0jadgz61","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":423,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fmxcbapw","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":423,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Typed requests worked; the same-chat check misleads the other way (name repeated in 88 of 132); deleting a conversation failed.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ulov258b","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":547,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kjal0jap","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":547,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Matched throughout; the only platform where it did.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lkj2toba","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":671,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yhs3y9sj","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":415,"top":671,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"The typed request meets expectation but looks like a failure in the usual check; deleting a conversation, the method chosen most, fails.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/cqxoju","slideIndex":3,"text":"A typed request worked on Claude, but deleting the conversation did not, which Anthropic's help page says. Asking in the same chat would make a working deletion look like a failure, and the method people choose most is the one that fails."}
