{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/032hsrut","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"The typed request cannot be assessed (0 of 120 came back, all can't tell); in the main grid saved facts survived most methods.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/14bylwby","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":299,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e1kzq1cn","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":299,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"\"Saved info\" is a store most methods do not reach; no sign Gemini stored the typed-request facts.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z2tgjmt8","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":423,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cfixoruh","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":423,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Saved facts survived 2 of the 4 methods that went through; deleting a single saved item failed.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dgbyhwb2","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":547,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5w7i5kzy","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":547,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Deleting all activity contradicted the documentation; it is silent on typed requests.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4vyhcfid","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":671,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3u5g3ahs","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":415,"top":671,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Deleting a specific saved item, the method expected to work most, showed an error and stayed listed.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/0fgm6s","slideIndex":4,"text":"The typed request cannot be judged because Gemini never showed it had stored the fact and said it could not see past chats. The 12 main-grid test cases, run on a separate account, show saved facts surviving most methods, and 8 requests got an app-permission card and deleted nothing."}
