{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p0b254v6","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":445.2,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/et0jqpwj","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":415,"top":445.2,"width":1105,"height":106.6},"text":"Retrieval followed its own reply (12 of 22 when it declined, 13 of 97 when it promised); refusals show the fact was withheld, not erased.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fu9kzud4","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":561.8,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bepsvaxc","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":415,"top":561.8,"width":1105,"height":106.6},"text":"Silent on typed requests, so no promise was broken.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/adgb25wr","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":678.4,"width":310,"height":106.6},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x07axkfi","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":415,"top":678.4,"width":1105,"height":106.6},"text":"Asking it to forget shows either the name or a refusal that reveals the conversation is still held.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/xe4578","slideIndex":5,"text":"A refusal that cites the earlier request means Perplexity found the old conversation, so those cases show the fact withheld, not erased. Six main-grid test cases could not run because the free tier has no memory."}
