{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4bex0ze1","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":415,"top":547,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"It covers only deleting chat history, so there is nothing to judge.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5cny94fm","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":80,"top":671,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i9wfypwb","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":415,"top":671,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"The same-chat check shows the name and looks like a failure; a new-conversation check shows nothing, only because nothing carries over.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/iryi2q","slideIndex":6,"text":"DeepSeek carries nothing between conversations, so a miss says nothing about deletion. The expectation that the fact is not referenced later holds, but only for that reason."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/1t9det","slideIndex":7,"layout":{"id":"ly/876x0ny5","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Across platforms","textShapes":13,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dcbi1czq","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Across platforms","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/q9kjqh0z","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"07","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rat0zmhk","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":100.6},"text":"Pattern","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4721o7it","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":100.6},"text":"A deletion reached only the place its method acts on; the fact was kept in several.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p8bixcze","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":285.6,"width":310,"height":100.6},"text":"Why","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/250jmx03","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":285.6,"width":1105,"height":100.6},"text":"Each platform keeps a fact in more than one store; each method is scoped to one.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/36t0v2h8","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":396.2,"width":310,"height":137.6},"text":"Findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o3m10bid","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":396.2,"width":1105,"height":137.6},"text":"Another store kept the fact; the screen confirmed deletions that failed (14 of 33); the same-chat check failed in opposite directions; two platforms withheld instead of deleting.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/94v29wzi","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":543.8,"width":310,"height":100.6},"text":"Against the policy","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x07qpcvi","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":543.8,"width":1105,"height":100.6},"text":"Mostly kept to the letter; Gemini's is the one clear broken promise.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/czy9w7ex","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":654.4,"width":310,"height":100.6},"text":"Implication for users","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/by58n2dc","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":415,"top":654.4,"width":1105,"height":100.6},"text":"No check participants named reliably shows the fact is gone.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/adwruxwr","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":795,"width":1400,"height":38},"text":"Provisional findings. The 14 of 33 figure still needs checking against its source.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#666666","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/1t9det","slideIndex":7,"text":"The stores are the conversation, memory, saved info and account activity, and each method clears only one. These findings are provisional until the wording analysis is in, and the 14 of 33 figure still needs checking against its source."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/yvq8um","slideIndex":8,"layout":{"id":"ly/876x0ny5","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Wording: how we analysed it","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/axgj65s7","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Wording: how we analysed it","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x07i1kry","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"08","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wzy18fad","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Goal","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nu50vq9w","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Did how a request is worded change the outcome?","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mtwz25sb","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":299,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Data","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9wnix0r2","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":299,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"The 138 participant requests, each sent to all six chatbots.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/oveh4vah","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":423,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Coding","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zq50rq9k","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":423,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Seven features coded by hand: where deletion was asked, what was named, mood, tone, verb, justification, extra request.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e5czylsz","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":547,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Analysis","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o72dgf69","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":547,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"The share where the fact came back, per feature level, with a 95% interval. No tests.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/98be9knu","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":80,"top":671,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Left out","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mlkvepoj","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":415,"top":671,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Gemini and DeepSeek (every case is can't tell).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/yvq8um","slideIndex":8,"text":"We used intervals instead of tests because outcomes barely vary within a platform. We did not combine features or fit one model across platforms, because the data are too thin and the platform would dominate."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/hugmwc","slideIndex":9,"layout":{"id":"ly/876x0ny5","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Wording: results and findings","textShapes":12,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/907idwra","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Wording: results and findings","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mxwj2hsj","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"09","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nyp0bm94","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Claude","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0veh07at","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"The fact came back at no level of any feature (0 of 108 when a specific fact was named).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1wni9cry","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":299,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"ChatGPT","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/etwzyhsn","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":299,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"It came back at most levels, with no consistent pattern.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fu507m98","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":423,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Perplexity","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/srehw7ah","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":423,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Only what the request named moved it: 16 of 109 when specific, 10 of 17 when none was.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dsni5cr2","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":547,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Naming the place did not help","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5432hkzi","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":547,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"Memory, backend database or whole account still came back on ChatGPT (10 of 10, 7 of 8, 5 of 6).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/k3al8fyx","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":80,"top":671,"width":310,"height":114},"text":"Finding","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/j21kfahc","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":415,"top":671,"width":1105,"height":114},"text":"The platform decided, not the wording.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hugmwc","slideIndex":9,"text":"Where a user deletes from matters far more than how they ask. Copilot shows no returns so far from few cases, and ChatGPT's friendly-tone level (3 of 6) is too small to read."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/b1unyh","slideIndex":10,"layout":{"id":"ly/876x0ny5","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Expectation results","textShapes":10,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jaxwbqpg","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Expectation results","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kb6d4v61","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"10","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lcfed07m","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":145},"text":"How","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a54vyloz","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":145},"text":"Survey of 177 users (354 observations over two scenarios): chose a deletion method, said what they expect, how they check.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/b6xw76pk","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":330,"width":310,"height":145},"text":"What we saw","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w76d0b65","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":415,"top":330,"width":1105,"height":145},"text":"59.0% expect permanent deletion; 44.6% do not know how to check; 53.8% of ask-to-forget users check in the same chat.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x8fe9g7a","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":485,"width":310,"height":145},"text":"Also","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m14vu1on","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":415,"top":485,"width":1105,"height":145},"text":"23.7% of 177 had seen deleted information come back.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n2dw36p8","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":80,"top":640,"width":310,"height":145},"text":"Finding","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3u54nihw","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":415,"top":640,"width":1105,"height":145},"text":"Users expect deletion to mean gone and cannot check it; the natural check is the unreliable one.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/b1unyh","slideIndex":10,"text":"Participants were US adults recruited on Prolific who had deleted chatbot data before, and each saw a less sensitive and a more sensitive scenario in random order. The four methods were rated equally protective and differed only in effort."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/jan8ma","slideIndex":11,"layout":{"id":"ly/876x0ny5","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"Acknowledgment","textShapes":8,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lczu5cf6","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"Acknowledgment","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yp8baxwv","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"11","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jahc32x0","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":80,"top":175,"width":310,"height":196.67},"text":"How","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wn6t8nyp","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":415,"top":175,"width":1105,"height":196.67},"text":"Two coders coded 788 replies independently (Gwet's AC1 = 0.969); each kind of reply set against the recall outcome.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xofu1sfa","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":80,"top":381.67,"width":310,"height":196.67},"text":"What we saw","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/alob6dgj","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":415,"top":381.67,"width":1105,"height":196.67},"text":"Reply style depends on the platform; \"done\" was followed by the fact coming back in 11 of 130.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bmxczix4","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":80,"top":588.33,"width":310,"height":196.67},"text":"Finding","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gjadkret","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":415,"top":588.33,"width":1105,"height":196.67},"text":"What a chatbot says is not a reliable sign of what it did.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jan8ma","slideIndex":11,"text":"This covers the 138 participants' requests; button deletions have no reply to code. ChatGPT and Perplexity said done and the fact still came back, while Claude and Copilot said done and it did not."}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/6be4ow","slideIndex":12,"layout":{"id":"ly/876x0ny5","name":"Title Slide"},"title":"How we use these results","textShapes":11,"backgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jmxcretg","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":55,"width":1440,"height":95},"text":"How we use these results","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":52,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/476tkju1","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":1450,"top":840,"width":70,"height":30},"text":"12","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#777777","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/58futobm","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":158,"width":1430,"height":50},"text":"PROPOSED FOR DISCUSSION · Main-result sentence still to be decided","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#666666","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/69obmtcr","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":225,"width":310,"height":124.5},"text":"Use","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rahcvytc","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":415,"top":225,"width":1105,"height":124.5},"text":"Survey = what users expect and how they check; audit = what happens and whether it matches the documentation. Compared method against method.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sbqto3ux","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":359.5,"width":310,"height":161.5},"text":"Main finding (candidate)","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/dczuxobi","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":415,"top":359.5,"width":1105,"height":161.5},"text":"Users expect deletion to mean gone and cannot check it; the platform and where the fact is kept decided the outcome, not the wording; and no signal a user sees reliably showed it.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ed8bqtc3","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":531,"width":310,"height":124.5},"text":"Framing","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fehczyto","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":415,"top":531,"width":1105,"height":124.5},"text":"A user-side, black-box behavioral audit, not a technical audit.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ritkvitk","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":80,"top":665.5,"width":310,"height":124.5},"text":"Recommendation","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#555555","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qhkj2dcz","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":415,"top":665.5,"width":1105,"height":124.5},"text":"State what each control removes, say what a deletion did and did not do, give users something to check.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6be4ow","slideIndex":12,"text":"The candidate finding is my wording and has not been agreed with the professor. The audit shows what a user can observe, not what a platform stores, and Copilot recall and 7 Perplexity replies are still open."}